# Committed measurement evidence (INV-18) is stored byte-for-byte, with no
# line-ending conversion in either direction. Without this, core.autocrlf would
# rewrite it on checkout, so the working copy would stop matching the committed
# artifact byte for byte -- harmless to pandas, not to anyone hashing or diffing
# the evidence.
#
# Note: these files arrived with CRLF endings, which a Kaggle (Linux) run would
# not produce, so they were most likely converted in transit before being
# committed. Values are unaffected; exact bytes may differ from the run's output.
data/measurements/** -text
